1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's Novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 9=

17
00:00:50,335 --> 00:00:51,595
(Cold Palace)

18
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,960
From the original Lu Yunluo's memories,

19
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:54,280
the Lu family

20
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:57,399
the Lu family has always been loyal,
with no hint of treason.

21
00:00:59,439 --> 00:01:01,840
Yet her father's letter in blood

22
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:04,120
points to Xiqing.

23
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:05,519
Could it be

24
00:01:06,879 --> 00:01:08,120
the Lu family betrayed Donglan?

25
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:11,644
(Escape the Palace now.
Go to Xiqing.)

26
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:17,560
If they really sided with Xiqing,

27
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,400
does that mean I have to

28
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,879
avenge my family and country

29
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,840
like some vengeful heroine?

30
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,719
What's that got to do with me?

31
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,840
I'm just

32
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,239
a frail, helpless woman.

33
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:35,319
First, I can't clear the Lu name.

34
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:38,159
Second, I don't want to betray Donglan.

35
00:01:38,439 --> 00:01:39,239
Don't overthink it.

36
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,359
Better focus on making money.

37
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,799
My little darlings.

38
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,280
Only you make me feel safe.

39
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,120
Once I've earned enough,

40
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,680
I'm getting out of this mess.

41
00:01:58,303 --> 00:01:59,130
(Yunluo's Wonder Shop)

42
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:01,480
Yunluo's Wonder Shop is open!

43
00:02:03,781 --> 00:02:05,141
(Smudge-Proof Makeup
No Cup Stains)

44
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:07,480
Smudge-proof, transfer-proof makeup!

45
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,840
Silken Skin Cooling Powder,

46
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,840
Golden Honey Wax Hair Removal Cream,

47
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,000
(Yunluo Pads)
Step right up!

48
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,439
(Three Soft Cotton Layers)
Don't miss out!

49
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:16,840
What's that?

50
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,240
Yinshuang.

51
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,000
(Yunluo's Wonder Shop)
Show it to our customers.

52
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,639
Yes, my lady.

53
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,240
That's amazing!

54
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,439
Palace drama keeping you up?

55
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:34,599
Leaks keeping you up at night?

56
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,520
Three soft cotton layers,

57
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,919
Five times more absorbent and leakproof!

58
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:40,120
That spring, beneath apricot blossoms,

59
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,280
you called me undignified.

60
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,960
Every girl in the palace is asking,

61
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,840
Are those Yunluo Pads you're using?

62
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,039
- Yunluo Pads!
- Yunluo Pads!

63
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,919
- A time traveler's wisdom
- A time traveler's wisdom

64
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:53,240
- protects you across time!
- protects you across time!

65
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:55,719
Where can I get one?

66
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,120
Right here!

67
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,080
We've got it all.

68
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:58,960
Plenty to go around!

69
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,120
I want one!

70
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,199
Wonderful!

71
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:06,080
(Yunluo Pads)
What is this?

72
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,199
(Yunluo's Wonder Shop)
New to me.

73
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,599
I'd love one of these.

74
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,759
Another Cold Palace creation.

75
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:14,199
What is this nonsense?

76
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,360
Take it away.

77
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,599
Everyone's scrambling to buy them.

78
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,400
I squeezed through the crowd

79
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,400
just to get this one.

80
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:24,439
All I know is

81
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,400
it has three soft cotton layers

82
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,759
and absorbs five times as much.

83
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,919
And those ice pops she sold before!

84
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:32,639
While every palace is rationing ice,

85
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:33,919
lowly maids

86
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:35,879
can get it for just 50!

87
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:38,719
Your Highness,

88
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:40,120
please remind the Empress Dowager

89
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,520
that's not how Yunluo Pads are used.

90
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,719
Lady Lu has His Majesty's support

91
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,280
and grows bolder by the day.

92
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,599
I'm sure you've all heard

93
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,599
His Majesty spent the night

94
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:56,080
in the Cold Palace a few days ago.

95
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:59,039
I was supposed to attend him that night.

96
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,080
The Passion Incense was mine...

97
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,960
Silence!

98
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,280
(Passion Incense?)

99
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:27,040
You're a smart woman.

100
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:30,639
You should know what to say

101
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:34,160
and what to keep to yourself.

102
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,360
Your Majesty,

103
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,199
I was distracted just now.

104
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,839
I didn't catch what Consort Yao said.

105
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,879
(Rather than waste time)

106
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:53,600
(on that useless fool,)

107
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:57,639
(I'd be better off backing Consort Lan.)

108
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,120
Consort Lan will handle

109
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,399
my birthday banquet next month.

110
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,079
Consort Yao will assist.

111
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,360
Aunt!

112
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,279
Don't forget to invite

113
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,319
the Empress

114
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,480
in the Cold Palace.

115
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,240
Yours.

116
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:20,879
Yours.

117
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,879
And yours.

118
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,480
Thank you, my lady.

119
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,800
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

120
00:05:26,439 --> 00:05:28,879
(Consort Lan arrives!)

121
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,639
-We'll take our leave.
-We'll take our leave.

122
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,560
Greetings, Your Highness.

123
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,439
You're the Empress, after all.

124
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,600
No need to be so formal.

125
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:44,800
Consort Lan,

126
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,639
did you like the new things I sent?

127
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:50,160
From food to daily necessities,

128
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,560
I loved every one of them.

129
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,160
You really are full of surprises.

130
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,680
Glad you liked them.

131
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,079
Wenxing.

132
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,600
You always think of me first.

133
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,839
I don't know how to repay you.

134
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:02,759
Just a small token.

135
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:11,720
You call this a small token?

136
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:15,439
I'd like to speak privately.

137
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,720
May we speak in private?

138
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,439
Come inside.

139
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:26,839
If you befriend Lady Lu,

140
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:28,319
won't you offend the Empress Dowager?

141
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,800
I won't cling to the Empress Dowager

142
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,360
and let her use me as a pawn.

143
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,319
Look at Consort Yao.

144
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:37,040
But that trade was hardly worth it.

145
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:40,079
A fine luminous pearl for a box of food?

146
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,199
It was part of your dowry!

147
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,959
I think it was well worth it.

148
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,920
Jewels are just possessions.

149
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,240
These are far more useful.

150
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,000
Then...

151
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,800
What about His Majesty?

152
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,959
You won't fight for His Majesty anymore?

153
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,759
Life is short.

154
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,920
Why fret over a man who doesn't love me?

155
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:59,600
We have each other. Isn't that enough?

156
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,079
Delicious.

157
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:01,879
Try some.

158
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,199
Mm.

159
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:03,839
Let's go.

160
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,079
Consort Lan said

161
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:10,000
That night, Ji Wujue was drugged
with Passion Incense.

162
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,199
It's sacred to the Southern Borderlands.

163
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:16,279
Lu Yunluo.

164
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,519
What's wrong with you?

165
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,920
Are you possessed?

166
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,959
Just now,

167
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,040
I nearly mistook Consort Yao for you.

168
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,240
How did Consort Yao get something
from the Southern Borderlands?

169
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,040
Could the Empress Dowager be...

170
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,800
(Donglan)
Donglan is the dominant power.

171
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:40,680
(Liu, Beicang)
Liu and Beicang are sworn enemies.

172
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,199
Xiqing and the Southern Borderlands
are both impregnable.

173
00:07:45,312 --> 00:07:47,099
(Liu, Donglan)

174
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:51,160
No, no, no.

175
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,199
This is making my head spin.

176
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,600
I'm not cut out for palace intrigue.

177
00:07:56,279 --> 00:07:57,399
Time for Plan B.

178
00:07:59,782 --> 00:08:00,968
(Rear Gate, Dog Hole
Abandoned Laundry Bureau)

179
00:08:04,172 --> 00:08:05,592
(Rear Gate)

180
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,240
3,668 taels in total.

181
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,639
After setting aside startup money,

182
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,879
I can buy a small place south of town.

183
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,800
Too bad I can't take Jia and Yi.

184
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:24,639
Oh, well.

185
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,040
Building a good life with Yinshuang

186
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,160
matters more than anything.

187
00:08:58,189 --> 00:08:59,610
(Rear Gate, Dog Hole
Abandoned Laundry Bureau)

188
00:08:59,610 --> 00:09:00,769
(Over the Wall
Cold Palace West Path)

189
00:09:04,659 --> 00:09:06,434
(Rear Gate, Dog Hole
Abandoned Laundry Bureau)

190
00:09:06,434 --> 00:09:08,186
(Over the Wall
Cold Palace West Path)

191
00:09:11,186 --> 00:09:12,800
(Cold Palace)

192
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:23,159
My gold ingots!

193
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:28,279
And my luminous pearl!

194
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:32,600
That heartless Lu Yunluo!

195
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,960
I've indulged her every whim,

196
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,720
yet she still wants to run away!

197
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,639
Do you mean

198
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:40,840
the Empress in the Cold Palace?

199
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,679
Who else?

200
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:44,879
Perhaps

201
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:46,159
I could arrange

202
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:47,639
two more guards.

203
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,120
No need.

204
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,679
I've taken all her money.

205
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:55,639
Let's see how she plans to escape now.

206
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,399
You were one step ahead, Your Majesty.

207
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,080
(Your Majesty.)

208
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,080
(Prince Rui requests an audience.)

209
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,399
Send him in.

210
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:07,919
Brother!

211
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,480
Wonderful news!

212
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:11,399
Once the notice letting merchants set
their own prices went up,

213
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,039
the grain merchants started infighting.

214
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,639
They slashed prices to unload stock.

215
00:10:15,639 --> 00:10:18,080
Some prices even fell below old levels!

216
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,159
We're amazing!

217
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,320
We?

218
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,679
As I recall,

219
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,360
you were the one most against it.

220
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:33,399
So when will you wear the dress?

221
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:36,039
I'm looking forward to it.

222
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:39,720
Brother, that was just a joke!

223
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:41,120
I'm a prince!

224
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:42,399
Me, wear a dress?

225
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,000
How improper!

226
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,759
What about the royal family's dignity?

227
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,279
A man should keep his word.

228
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,480
What?

229
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:52,279
Would you break your word to a woman?

230
00:10:52,519 --> 00:10:54,120
She's not here anyway.

231
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,039
Who says I'm not?

232
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:58,799
Pay up.

233
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:04,879
When did I ever owe you money?

234
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,919
Jia and Yi said you came by last night.

235
00:11:07,919 --> 00:11:08,960
Who else could it be?

236
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,120
When I woke up this morning,

237
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:10,840
my money

238
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,440
and my luminous pearl were gone!

239
00:11:12,879 --> 00:11:13,799
Brother,

240
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:17,120
that wasn't very honorable of us either.

241
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,799
You!

242
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:23,919
Hmph.

243
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,960
(Ruined Temple Outside the City)
If you weren't so set on escaping,

244
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,240
why would I bother taking your money?

245
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,799
I...

246
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:35,639
Brother,

247
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,759
I'll leave you two to talk.

248
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:38,919
If there's nothing else,

249
00:11:39,159 --> 00:11:40,600
I'll take my leave.

250
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:41,600
- Wait!
- Wait!

251
00:11:42,679 --> 00:11:43,679
Cao Zhongquan.

252
00:11:43,679 --> 00:11:44,679
Here, Your Majesty.

253
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:46,639
Have the Laundry Bureau
bring a woman's outfit.

254
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:47,320
Yes, Your Majesty.

255
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,080
Make it pink.

256
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,080
It'll flatter Prince Rui's complexion.

257
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:52,799
You... you...

258
00:11:52,799 --> 00:11:53,360
This...

259
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:55,159
Red suits me better.

260
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,120
(Twenty years in this palace,)

261
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:05,360
(only her laughter has stirred
the rusty bells beneath the eaves.)

262
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:08,080
(Even these cold halls)

263
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,960
(grow warm with her laughter.)

264
00:12:16,559 --> 00:12:17,480
Cao Zhongquan.

265
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,519
Here, Your Majesty.

266
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,960
Have the Palace Service Office prepare.

267
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:23,320
The Empress will attend me tonight.

268
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:25,000
As you command.

269
00:12:25,399 --> 00:12:26,200
What?

270
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,600
What's with that reaction?

271
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,320
Are you defying my order?

272
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:29,960
Well...

273
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:33,320
I'm not defying you.

274
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:34,960
After all,

275
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,919
you're handsome,

276
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:38,080
in great shape,

277
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,000
and rich and powerful.

278
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,639
I wouldn't be losing out.

279
00:12:40,879 --> 00:12:41,320
Well...

280
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,279
It's just...

281
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,120
my body picked a bad time.

282
00:12:44,399 --> 00:12:45,279
I...

283
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,720
just got my period.

284
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,399
So what?

285
00:12:53,039 --> 00:12:54,720
I wasn't planning to touch you.

286
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,519
I...

287
00:12:56,919 --> 00:12:58,159
I talk in my sleep.

288
00:12:58,159 --> 00:12:59,080
I snore.

289
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,320
And grind my teeth.

290
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,720
Perfect.

291
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:05,000
I happen to like that.

292
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:08,120
I kick people in my sleep too!

293
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:09,960
That's fine.

294
00:13:10,279 --> 00:13:11,600
I've trained in martial arts for years.

295
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:16,600
I'm a little...

296
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,320
Lu Yunluo.

297
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,399
Keep this up,

298
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,759
or I'll have you bound and hauled here.

299
00:13:48,083 --> 00:13:52,113
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

300
00:13:52,503 --> 00:13:56,723
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

301
00:13:56,763 --> 00:14:00,943
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

302
00:14:01,003 --> 00:14:05,193
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

303
00:14:05,533 --> 00:14:09,593
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

304
00:14:09,663 --> 00:14:13,843
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

305
00:14:14,283 --> 00:14:17,653
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

306
00:14:18,123 --> 00:14:22,803
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

307
00:14:24,463 --> 00:14:26,613
♪No finery to rival spring♪

308
00:14:26,793 --> 00:14:31,093
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

309
00:14:33,503 --> 00:14:35,253
♪Where is beauty found?♪

310
00:14:35,433 --> 00:14:39,863
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

311
00:14:40,423 --> 00:14:41,993
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

312
00:14:42,013 --> 00:14:44,483
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

313
00:14:44,553 --> 00:14:46,633
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

314
00:14:46,793 --> 00:14:48,563
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

315
00:14:49,173 --> 00:14:50,443
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

316
00:14:50,673 --> 00:14:53,073
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

317
00:14:53,313 --> 00:14:55,613
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

318
00:14:55,893 --> 00:15:00,213
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
